# skill: sidebar

## Contract

Sidebar navigation component providing a vertical navigation panel with header, nav items, and toggle support. Renders as a fixed-width aside element with dark theme styling. Active item is highlighted with a blue left border and lighter background.

**Slots**: none (self-contained)

**Children**: none

## Dependencies

- `button-primary` (implicit — toggle button uses primary button styling pattern)

## Slots

None — sidebar is a self-contained component that receives its navigation items via props (React) or renders static HTML structure.

## Boundaries

- Prohibits: direct child element injection (items must be provided via `items` prop in React or pre-rendered in HTML)
- Width is fixed at 240px desktop, collapses to 60px on mobile (< 768px)
- Title and label text hidden on mobile; only icons visible

## Examples

### React Usage

```jsx
const navItems = [
  { value: 'dashboard', label: '儀表板', icon: '📊' },
  { value: 'list', label: '列表', icon: '📋' },
  { value: 'settings', label: '設定', icon: '⚙️' },
];

<Sidebar items={navItems} activeItem="dashboard" onNavigate={console.log} />
```

### HTML Usage

```html
<aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
  <div class="sidebar-header">
    <span class="sidebar-logo">📦</span>
    <span class="sidebar-title">系統</span>
  </div>
  <nav class="sidebar-nav" id="sidebar-nav">
    <a class="nav-item active" href="#" onclick="navigate('dashboard')">
      <span class="nav-icon">📊</span> 儀表板
    </a>
    <a class="nav-item" href="#" onclick="navigate('list')">
      <span class="nav-icon">📋</span> 列表
    </a>
    <a class="nav-item" href="#" onclick="navigate('settings')">
      <span class="nav-icon">⚙️</span> 設定
    </a>
  </nav>
  <button class="sidebar-toggle" onclick="toggleSidebar()">☰</button>
</aside>
```

[html]
<aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
  <div class="sidebar-header">
    <span class="sidebar-logo">📦</span>
    <span class="sidebar-title">系統</span>
  </div>
  <nav class="sidebar-nav" id="sidebar-nav">
    <a class="nav-item active" href="#" onclick="navigate('dashboard')">
      <span class="nav-icon">📊</span> 儀表板
    </a>
    <a class="nav-item" href="#" onclick="navigate('list')">
      <span class="nav-icon">📋</span> 列表
    </a>
    <a class="nav-item" href="#" onclick="navigate('settings')">
      <span class="nav-icon">⚙️</span> 設定
    </a>
  </nav>
  <button class="sidebar-toggle" onclick="toggleSidebar()">☰</button>
</aside>

[react]
const Sidebar = ({ items = [], activeItem, onNavigate }) => {
  return (
    <aside className="sidebar">
      <div className="sidebar-header">
        <span className="sidebar-logo">📦</span>
        <span className="sidebar-title">系統</span>
      </div>
      <nav className="sidebar-nav">
        {items.map(item => (
          <a key={item.value} className={"nav-item" + (activeItem === item.value ? " active" : "")} href="#" onClick={e => { e.preventDefault(); onNavigate(item.value); }}>
            <span className="nav-icon">{item.icon}</span> {item.label}
          </a>
        ))}
      </nav>
    </aside>
  );
};

[style]
.sidebar {
  width: 240px;
  min-height: 100vh;
  background: #1e293b;
  color: #e2e8f0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.sidebar-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  padding: 20px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;
}
.sidebar-logo { font-size: 24px; }
.sidebar-title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; }
.sidebar-nav { flex: 1; padding: 12px 0; }
.nav-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  padding: 12px 20px;
  color: #94a3b8;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 14px;
  transition: all 0.15s;
  border-left: 3px solid transparent;
}
.nav-item:hover { background: #334155; color: #e2e8f0; }
.nav-item.active { background: #334155; color: #fff; border-left-color: #3b82f6; }
.nav-icon { font-size: 18px; }
.sidebar-toggle { display: none; }
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .sidebar { width: 60px; }
  .sidebar-title, .nav-item span:not(.nav-icon) { display: none; }
  .nav-item { justify-content: center; padding: 12px; }
}